@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@parcelId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### Overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/forge/current-use/alpha/parcels/{{parcelId}}/overview

### Rollback
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/forge/current-use/alpha/rollback/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parcelId": "{{parcelId}}",
  "classificationType": "FARM_AND_AGRICULTURAL",
  "removalDate": "2026-03-15",
  "taxYearOfRemoval": 2026
}
